          "maxItems": 10,
          "help": "Label each Light (daylight) or Dark (blacklight). The site pairs the first Light with the first Dark, the second with the second, for the blacklight toggle; a photo with no partner gets a blacklight tint instead. A half-and-half or scale photo is Light. Etsy takes 10.",
